# Agent Workflow

- Use planning before multi-file edits (architect → plan in `.cursor/plans/active/`).
- Keep one agent session focused on one task.
- Prefer small diffs.
- Do not refactor unrelated code.
- Preserve public behavior unless explicitly asked.
- Add or update tests with behavior changes.
- Run the narrowest relevant validation command first.
- Summarize changed files and test results before finishing.
- When context becomes noisy, create or update a plan file and start a fresh chat.
- Use project agents for domain work: `@catalog-agent`, `@graph-agent`, `@pipeline-agent`, etc.
